OL,3,GNEWSAHealth spending on Southampton
OL,4,Ataxis surges by 75%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe amount of money spent on taxis for
OL,7,FJersey patients visiting Southampton
OL,8,Fhospital and the surrounding area has
OL,9,Frisen by 75% in two years.
OL,11,FIn 2023, #140,594 was spent on taxi
OL,12,Fprovision, which surged to #246,542 in
OL,13,F2025.
OL,15,FIslanders can request a taxi if it is
OL,16,F"not possible or practical" to use
OL,17,Fpublic transport, or if there is a
OL,18,F"medical reason" to do so.
OL,20,FThe Health department has been asked
OL,21,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
